      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.34,
          "en": "Slots are a powerful feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.34,
          "end": 6.8,
          "en": "but now we broke the styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.8,
          "end": 10.64,
          "en": "We broke the styling of our user info component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.64,
          "end": 13.283,
          "en": "where the batch should be next to the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 17.35,
          "en": "because we previously targeted this header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.35,
          "end": 19.51,
          "en": "to apply our styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.51,
          "end": 23.13,
          "en": "Now we're sending this content into a header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.13,
          "end": 25.94,
          "en": "but into a header of a different component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.94,
          "end": 27.533,
          "en": "of the BaseCard component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.88,
          "end": 32.41,
          "en": "Now you could think that the content that sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.41,
          "end": 35.56,
          "en": "into a header is to find in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.56,
          "end": 38.44,
          "en": "where this styling is scoped to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.44,
          "end": 40.65,
          "en": "and (murmurs) the component it's being sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 42.92,
          "en": "to the BaseCard component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.92,
          "end": 45.89,
          "en": "should be affected by this styling as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.89,
          "end": 47.84,
          "en": "But that's not how Vue works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.84,
          "end": 49.53,
          "en": "There is a very simple rule",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.53,
          "end": 51.17,
          "en": "when working with slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.17,
          "end": 55.51,
          "en": "and when sending content into other components slots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.51,
          "end": 57.72,
          "en": "nothing changes about what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.72,
          "end": 60.51,
          "en": "you learned regarding scoped styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.51,
          "end": 64.16,
          "en": "availability of data and props and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.16,
          "end": 67.8,
          "en": "For example, fullName, this prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.8,
          "end": 69.98,
          "en": "which we have available and UserInfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.98,
          "end": 74.36,
          "en": "is also still only available here in UserInfo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.36,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "It's not a available in BaseCard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 80.783,
          "en": "even though we are sending this markup to BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.68,
          "end": 85.13,
          "en": "But Vue.js will analyze, compile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.13,
          "end": 89.69,
          "en": "and evaluate this template before it sends to content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.69,
          "end": 92.38,
          "en": "to the other component so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.38,
          "end": 94.99000000000001,
          "en": "So therefore, here we have access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.99000000000001,
          "end": 97.87,
          "en": "to whatever is defined inside of UserInfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.87,
          "end": 99.66,
          "en": "and to styling defined here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.66,
          "end": 102.24000000000001,
          "en": "also affects this markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.24000000000001,
          "end": 105.08,
          "en": "but not the markup of any component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.08,
          "end": 107.543,
          "en": "we might be sending our content to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "That's how this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 112.52000000000001,
          "en": "And that's why this header style here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.52000000000001,
          "end": 116.16,
          "en": "does not affect the header in base card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.16,
          "end": 119,
          "en": "So if you want to affect this header, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119,
          "end": 122.72,
          "en": "what we should do is grab this selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.72,
          "end": 125.15,
          "en": "remove it in UserInfo and therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.15,
          "end": 127,
          "en": "since we have no styles left,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127,
          "end": 129.07,
          "en": "removed the entire style tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.07,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "and go to BaseCard instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 134.61,
          "en": "and then in the scoped styling there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.61,
          "end": 136.653,
          "en": "we can add the header styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.35,
          "end": 141.21,
          "en": "And with that, we got the look from before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.21,
          "end": 143.17000000000002,
          "en": "because now we moved the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.17000000000002,
          "end": 144.463,
          "en": "to the appropriate place.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
